<!--
  Fixture F-05 (Plan Part 08): one note, sixteen sixteenths, with a
  sixteenth REST at the start of the second beat.

  Expected: down-up-down-up across each beat, and the note straight
  after the rest keeps the grid rather than starting a fresh
  down-stroke -- the picking hand went on moving through the rest
  (RH-P01's ghost strokes), which is why the rule is about the grid
  and not about the notes.
-->
